    "sub_name": "高分子工程",
    "sub_ename": "POLYMER ENGINEERING",
    "describe_ch": "高分子工程這一門課程的目的主要在介紹高分子成型程序與工程應用。這些應用結合了熱力學，輸送現象，反應動力學以及工程性質與分子特性的關聯性。",
    "describe_eh": "Engineering of polymerization and polymer forming processes based upon thermodynamics, transport phenomena, and reaction kinetics; relationship of engineering properties of high polymers to molecular characteristics　",
